// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESAVIOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3365707981" "Looks like scamping is coming back to the Big Bad Cole, now ain't it?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESAVIOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3353978863" "Say there, Normie, how's that PPD lovin' working out for ya?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESAVIOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1974003020" "You gotta jump to the beat of your own drumstick if you wanna stay outta the PPD's playpens, slammer."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1851807105" "Man! Why's it always us chompers you give the double-stickin' to?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3441296328" "You're lucky as grape seeds that I can't give you some what-for!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2069013176" "Let me go and I'll scamp like nobody's business, okay?  I swear!  Really!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1313299226" "I'm outta here like a hotflap in Winter!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1334384165" "Shiftin' it!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_RESISTANCESUSPECT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3054940525" "You're giving a full fledged 11-7, and I'll remember that, pal!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1948880659" "Ignorance of the law is a crime unto itself."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P5178357" "Law-abiding citizens are happy citizens, and happiness is mandatory."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P626054243" "If anyone even thinks of committing a crime, that's proof of their law-breaking intent."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_ALERTCHASE_TEXT :
"P1326893560" "You're going nowhere, scum!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_ALERTCHASE_TEXT :
"P1838268532" "Stop now and we won't have to beat you too badly."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_PPDEXECUTIONER_ALERTCHASE_TEXT :
"P628248118" "Stop where you are and I won't hurt you.  I promise with all my heart."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2377796686" "But I didn't do anything.  Why are you arresting me?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P256741149" "What did I do wrong?  Will someone please tell me?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2126771464" "I promise I swear to Cole that I didn't do anything!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4133547719" "Please let me go! I have a family that needs me."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4118578634" "I can't believe our perfect city has come to this!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P632459029" "How could Emperor Cole allow this to happen to me?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_SAVESUSPECT_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2813090752" "But I thought everything was safe here.  How is this possible?"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1014434110" "Oh my gosh!  I'm so out of here!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P769109621" "I'll never forget this!  Thank you!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1538233763" "I'm never leaving my house again!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P326107699" "I'm not sticking around for all of this!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3890875676" "You either get that grid double-tapped quick as Mother Goose or we'll get scamped even quicker, got it?"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145042379" "Shift it, slammer!  Sketchy ain't even close to what I'm grooving right now!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P657556748" "How much longer 'til you're done? Those truffle-hunting Cole-Aiders will be here any minute!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2194508771" "Heads up... looks like we've got scampers at 11 o' Noon!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3849563041" "Time for some good ol' fashioned sneakers and bow ties, if you know what I'm sayin'!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P291904817" "Head, shoulders, knees and toes everyone!  Nosy-Nellies are incoming!"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2886493047" "You wanna stick your wiggle-digits in this?  I dog-dog-dog dare ya!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1448911835" "I'm cranking out cycles faster than a sheepy wolf, got it?!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3253021451" "Any second now and we'll be doing this tea-and-biscuits style, okay?"

// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEPROTEST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P3019067690" "We took care of that Resistance protest.  Let's go get a coffee."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEPROTEST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P1543677534" "Resistance scum are all accounted for.  Let's go look for the ones' that aren't."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEPROTEST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P3235287012" "Next time I see one of those Resistance schmucks they'll get a close look at how nicely shined my boots are."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEPROTEST_PPD_SITUATION_NORMAL_TEXT :
"P3651134284" "Everything's in it's place right now, which I don't trust in the slightest."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4226088713" "Yeah, we cleaned up the stink of Resistance.  We're clear here.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P806762704" "Nothing on this end.  I'm not spotting anything out of the ordinary. Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1939982887" "They did what? They put Frank in the hospital?  Oh... I really hope the next one see puts up a fight.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3851518964" "I'm following one right now, though they don't know it.  I'll need back-up in a few minutes.  Over."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2780066928" "Looks like they're going to put up a fight this time.  Gotta go, Central!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2904790124" "Looks like we have stupid one here.  A really stupid one.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P110575783" "Central, we have a situation.  Looks like we have some resistance.  Authorization for unnecessary force requested.  Over."
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1581300543" "We have a suspect in sight.  Following pre-emptive retaliation procedures, Over."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P658754165" "They scamped us!  Send some slammers!  Two-minute style or I'm done for!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1160087493" "Gonna need some triple-muscle here and FAST!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3620638850" "Things aren't looking good here. I think they're actually serious!  This isn't fun anymore."

// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1267848680" "I've got a plate of hot eggs here for ya, buddy!  Come get some!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1707944823" "Scamper, scamper, scamper... You're about to get a face-full of slammer!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4001820782" "Oh... not again.  This wasn't actually supposed to happen for real!"

// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2412202851" "I'm going!"
// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1676107325" "I knew this would happen!"
// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3286166331" "Why does this always happen to me?"
// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1985601817" "I'm not sticking around to get hurt any further!"
// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2211842061" "I hope you can take care of this yourself!"

// IMPERIALCITY_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2775442681" "Run!"

// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1261006689" "Aw, man!  We got eagle-eyed!  Get ready for it!"
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2455591098" "I hope you can finish that in the next two seconds, slammer.  We've got company."
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2757869173" "No more time.  We've got to do this 11-7 now."

// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3214907163" "Um... do you know what it means when all the lights flash red?"
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3367369135" "What the squiggle? I totally had this flipped not two seconds ago!"
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2091006973" "Hehe... the Big Bad Cole is gonna be eatin' flopburgers by candlelight when I'm done here!"

// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2556472069" "Funklemunch!!! I was so close to havin' it tapped!"
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P202896483" "Now I gotta start it from the intro screen because of you, scamper!"
// IMPERIALCITY_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070318430" "You mean I gotta take it from top again?  Sweetness!  I love doin' this!"

// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3243118273" "Resistance scum tided up for the time-being.  Man, I hate those guys.  Over."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3666030228" "I have a group of Resistance filth on their way to the hospital. Over."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P491519203" "All citizens in sight are acting appropriately. Over."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1092316351" "Still waiting on that bench-warrant, Central.  Can we please speed this up some? Over."

// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3641005232" "This isn't your fight, citizen.  Move along or suffer the consequences."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4014284820" "Move along.  Any resistance will be met with appropriate force, citizen."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2785192665" "We obviously have a member of the Resistance here.  Bad move, kid."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESISTANCEDEFEATED_PPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3237548504" "To think, my day was getting quite boring."

// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2248365024" "He looks like a sack of potatoes.  Too heavy for my back."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P661311821" "I'm not going to be able to haul the lug back to the hidey-hole, guys."
// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1402974064" "Ten-twenty-seven guys!  Uh, no, I mean ten-seventy-two!  And I mean PRONTO!"
// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3774662432" "Need help!  Send the cavalry, or tanks, or the space-men or whatever we've got!"

// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2940004159" "This didn't turn out as planned!  We've got a chomper in love with daisies here!"
// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2647240177" "I don't know how many we are out here, but we're not in Kansas anymore, if you know what I'm sayin'!"
// IMPERIALCITY_RESMANDOWN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1001011173" "The water's floodin' in and I'm running outta fingers here! Get some help!  Over!"

// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3580113582" "Look, we got a deal or what?"
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2344477913" "Yes or no.  That's all I need to hear from you."
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P960447897" "The more you yammer, the more likely we'll be caught talking to each other."
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3089810741" "You're talking, but you're not giving me the answer I want."
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4023580235" "I don't care about your reputation, quite frankly.  You think I don't have one?  We got a deal or what?"
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3844898525" "Why are you making this so painful? Do we have a deal or not?"
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3011910616" "Yes, yes, yes, I know the gravity of the situation.  Believe me, I have six doctorates.  Now let's get this over with."
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2408506192" "Further conversation may breach the sensitivity of these dealings, so I would advise silence as we conclude this.  In other words, shut up and get on with it."
// IMPERIALCITY_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3093410041" "You have no idea the amount of risk I'm putting myself in.  Can we please hurry up?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1334436685" "I can't believe I let this happen to me."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1255042170" "Is this seriously happening?  No, I mean is this actually, really happening?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2365628315" "At least I've got someone here who knows what they're doing."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3916821977" "Am I going to be safe?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2149850007" "I'm really going to need to reconsider living here."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2962788165" "When did everything go wrong?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2416507082" "I got this all under control!  Trust me... what could possibly go wrong?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4191039388" "This is just like eating crab cakes, if you know what I'm sayin'.  Right?  I knew you would."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3256780945" "I don't know how I got into this situation, but you know?  I'm likin' it!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2766787766" "Oh my gosh!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1888849899" "I...  ACK!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2164738786" "This is too much for even me! "
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3874309018" "Sorry, but I can't handle all this excitement!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ESCORT_ESCORTEE_FLEE_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2837823039" "What did I do to deserve this?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P242978905" "Well I could possibly be persuaded..."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1720927404" "I'm not sure that's what we agreed upon."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2554540970" "And you think that's fair, do you?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1803042978" "This could ruin my reputation as much as it could ruin yours.  So let's cut to the chase."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1855161515" "Well, I don't know.  In fact, I get the feeling you're holding out on me.  Now why would that be?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P66959336" "I'm getting a sneaky feeling that I may not be on the beneficial end of this bargain."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3470638044" "Trust me, I'm a scientist.  We're known for being straight-forward in our dealings."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SHADY_SCIENTIST_DEALING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1990141378" "If anyone sees me, my career is ruined!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P673371558" "This gig is running longer than you said, chomper.  I'm getting the queasies!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3856047030" "Ay scamper comes this way, they'll get a whole bag of what-for!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_GUARD_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3287870181" "I'm gettin' sketchy, and it's already gone past eleven!  Can you hurry it up?"

// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599526486" "I'll squeeze all the juice outta this little puppy in no time.  Just gimme a few more secs, okay?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P414908702" "I'd love to see the guy's face who did the security for this grid."
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3331682875" "This little weasly bugger is really bugging me.  I should have been done by now."

// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2931981868" "I was just about there, too!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3522179619" "Are you kidding me? Now?  Seriously... now?  Right when I was done?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_POWERTAPPER_TAPPER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P729983229" "I knew it was too good to be true!"

// RIFTENCLOSURE_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P819177502" "I should no longer exist."





// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P589227101" "You can't stop us!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2924853487" "Get them to safety!"
// NOVAPRAETORIA_ESCORT_ESCORTER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"


