// UNDERGROUND_RESISTANCE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P680666595" "Tell 'em down there we're bringing the entertainment!"
// UNDERGROUND_RESISTANCE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
