// NEUTROPOLIS_SCOUTS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3015570018" "Scopin' a flat punkwad at eleveteen o'clock!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SCOUTS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
