// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1799888283" "First time ain't free.  I want a fatty hand o' cash bills"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3720497876" "Tons more where this came from.<em t=1>And by tons more, I mean some, as in not a lot."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3093882759" "Busting up the deal?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P720147261" "You ain't bringin me in copper!  Or tin!  Or whatever you are!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3979002060" "Hey, slamcakes, that's not how a deal is done."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4031451750" "Make it quick like.  Cole's been peeping like crazy!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
