// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2868496608" "Yeah, those are some Grade A biscuits-monkeys you got there."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_RES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
